  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building resilience and supporting communities affected by displacement in Amhara, SNNP and Somali Regions (UNFPA, UNHCR/2025-2028 / 9.969 million USD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adaptive resilience of people affected by conflict and climate crisis focusing on youth is improved in Afar and South Ethiopia Regional State through HDP NexusHDP &#xb125;&#xc11c;&#xc2a4;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xbd84;&#xc7c1; &#xbc0f; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xc704;&#xae30;&#xc5d0; &#xc601;&#xd5a5;&#xc744; &#xbc1b;&#xc740; &#xccad;&#xb144; &#xc911;&#xc2ec;&#xc758; &#xc801;&#xc751;&#xd68c;&#xbcf5;&#xb825; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Socially and economically capacitated youth as change agents for self-reliance, Strengthened systems/institutions in service delivery to ensure human dignity and social inclusion, Improved enabling environment for promoting youth rights</narrative>
  </description>
